" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "II and III only"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "3476da2cbcda90a45fdc354b6f8a5a5158e9f22d879646a83165a6cbe0c9d352" "basis" 1968 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-93721" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "II only"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "3476da2cbcda90a45fdc354b6f8a5a5158e9f22d879646a83165a6cbe0c9d352" "basis" 1968 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-93721" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "III only"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "3476da2cbcda90a45fdc354b6f8a5a5158e9f22d879646a83165a6cbe0c9d352" "basis" 1968 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-338102" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following second-order differential equations are linear?\n\n- $x{y}^{″}+y={x}^{2}$\n- $y{y}^{″}+{y}^{′}=x$\n- $5{y}^{″}-{x}^{2}{y}^{′}+7{y}^{2}=x$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "3476da2cbcda90a45fdc354b6f8a5a5158e9f22d879646a83165a6cbe0c9d352" "basis" 1968 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-338102" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "А second-order linear differential equation has the form\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=f(x).\n$$\n\nLet's look at each equation in turn.\n\n- The equation \n\n$$\nx{y}^{″}+y={x}^{2}\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)=x,b(x)=0,c(x)=1,$ and $f(x)={x}^{2}.$\n\n- The equation \n\n$$\ny{y}^{″}+{y}^{′}=x\n$$\n\nis **NOT** linear because it contains the nonlinear term $y{y}^{″}.$\n\n- The equation \n\n$$\n5{y}^{″}-{x}^{2}{y}^{′}+7{y}^{2}=x\n$$\n\nis **NOT** linear because it contains the nonlinear term $7{y}^{2}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "3476da2cbcda90a45fdc354b6f8a5a5158e9f22d879646a83165a6cbe0c9d352" "basis" 1968 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-338102" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "150eef360fa6ca4370556dd37534d366c488edc736bb946f58aa913b35ef5b0b" "basis" 1968 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-338102" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14061497/state.json" "file_sha256" "3476da2cbcda90a45fdc354b6f8a5a5158e9f22d879646a83165a6cbe0c9d352"